5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Hello everyone. It seems our current billing arrangement is a relic of a smaller household. To ensure we transition to a system that is both logical and fair, I suggest we start by examining the data.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited we're finally sorting this out! I agree with Benjamin—let's make sure we have all the facts first so everything is fair and easy for everyone! What should we check first?,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a pleasure to be here with you all. I agree that a calm, data-driven approach is best. It would be wise to see how things have actually been handled up until now.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree. It is important that we understand the actual financial flow before we commit to a new system. We should be thorough to avoid any unexpected burdens later on.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,"Hello! I'm glad we're all talking about this together. I want everyone to be happy and get along, so I think looking at the facts is a good idea. I'm curious to see how it works!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I shall examine the ""Plug-in monitor readings room by room"" and ""Sunlight and heating need by room."" It would be a tragedy to ignore the physical realities of our living spaces in favor of simple math.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I want to see the ""Trial run of a reconciliation template"" and the ""Monthly settle observed at another house""! I'm curious if there's a super easy way to handle the math without it being a headache!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I will look into the ""Payment log for the last twelve months"" and ""Settling up when the last rooms filled."" I believe it is important to understand the history of our contributions to ensure a peaceful transition.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I will look into ""The last twelve utility statements"" and the ""Electrician's quote for the rooms."" I want to understand the annual fluctuations in cost and any potential expenses for updating our setup.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I'll look into the ""Payment log for the last twelve months"" and ""Settling up when the last rooms filled."" I want to see how we've been doing things and if anyone felt sad about it.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems we have a comprehensive division of labor. While some of us are focusing on the ledger, I shall be the one to investigate the actual energy consumption of our rooms. Logic dictates that usage varies.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, you're so serious! But I think it's great we're covering everything. I'm just hoping to find a way that doesn't take forever to figure out every month! I can't wait to see the results!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe we have a balanced approach. By looking at both the physical usage and the financial history, we can find a solution that brings peace of mind to everyone in the house.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree. Having a clear picture of both the historical costs and the technical requirements will prevent us from making a decision based on assumptions. I look forward to seeing what we discover.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'm happy that we're all helping each other! I hope the things we find will help us be even kinder to one another. I'll go look at my things now! See you soon!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. Let us all proceed with our respective investigations. I shall return shortly, hopefully with some illuminating data that prevents us from freezing in the name of ""simplicity"" this coming winter. See you all soon.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mio,,"I'm ready! I'm going to go hunt for those easy-peasy ways to do the bills right now! I hope we find a system that's super fast and fun! See you all in a bit, bye-bye!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I shall begin my research now. I hope that by understanding our past, we can move forward with a clear heart and a quiet mind. I will see you all in the next round.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will begin my research now. I want to ensure we have a precise understanding of the annual costs and any initial investments required. I will see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'll go look at the logs now! I hope we can find a way to make everyone feel good about the bills. See you all later!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
