35,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"My findings are quite illuminating. It appears some of us are essentially living in refrigerators while others enjoy a tropical paradise, with energy consumption varying by as much as fourfold. A simple split would be a curious form of injustice.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Wow, that's a huge difference, Benjamin! But I found out that the ""easy"" ways are actually kind of a nightmare! Even with a template or room meters, it takes so much time and manual work to figure everything out!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"My research reveals that our past transitions have been somewhat unsettled. There were several delays in payments and some confusion when new members joined, suggesting that our previous methods lacked clarity and caused friction.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The utility statements show extreme volatility, with costs swinging from 9,100 to nearly 30,000 yen. Furthermore, installing sub-meters would be a significant investment, costing 34,000 yen per room plus annual maintenance. We must consider these financial realities.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,"I found that some payments were very late, and it took a long time to agree on what the new people should pay. It makes me sad to think that the bills might have made us feel upset.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, spending over 170,000 yen to install meters seems a bit excessive, unless we enjoy paying for the privilege of knowing exactly how cold we are. However, ignoring the fourfold difference in usage is equally illogical.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, I agree! Spending that much money sounds crazy. But @Victoria, if the bills change that much every month, it'll be even harder for whoever has to do the math! I'm really worried about how much time this will take.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, @Victoria, it seems we are caught between the desire for precision and the reality of cost. However, the friction I found in the logs suggests that the real cost is the tension it creates among us.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Jonathan, you are right that tension is a cost, but financial instability is also a source of stress. With costs fluctuating so wildly, a system that doesn't account for seasonal peaks could be a heavy burden for some.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Jonathan, I agree. It feels like the money is making us a little bit grumpy with each other. I don't want us to be sad or avoid each other just because of the bills. Can we find a way to be happy again?","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, your optimism is refreshing, though happiness rarely survives a freezing room. If we simply split the bill equally, those in the colder rooms will be penalized for the misfortune of their architecture. That is a recipe for resentment.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, I get that, but if we make the system too complicated to be ""fair,"" the person doing the work will just be miserable! I saw how long it takes to log everything by hand—it's a total time-sink! We need something fast!","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, I understand your concern for time. However, if we prioritize speed over clarity, we may simply repeat the patterns of confusion and late payments I found in the logs. A little more effort now could ensure long-term peace.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, I understand the desire for simplicity, but we cannot ignore the volatility. If we choose a fast system that doesn't address the seasonal spikes, the financial burden will remain unpredictable and potentially overwhelming for some of us.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, @Jonathan, I think it's okay if it takes a little more time if it means we don't have to be grumpy. I just want us to be honest about the things that made us sad before.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Honesty is a noble goal, Minato, but it is far more effective when paired with a system that removes the cause of the sadness. We must acknowledge that some rooms are objectively more expensive to inhabit than others.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, I totally agree that some rooms are more expensive! But we can't forget that someone has to actually *do* the work. If it's a total nightmare to calculate, that person will be the one who's sad!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"It is true that the labor of calculation is a burden. However, the silence of unresolved resentment is often heavier. I believe we should seek a balance that is clear enough to prevent disputes, yet simple enough to be sustainable.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. We must find a middle ground. However, we cannot overlook the fact that the cost of precision—specifically sub-meters—is prohibitively high. We need a solution that manages seasonal volatility without bankrupting us or creating an administrative nightmare.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,"I hope we can find a way that doesn't make anyone feel like they're being accused. If we just keep smoothing things over, maybe the grumpiness will stay. I want us to be really honest so we can be friends again.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
